        {
          "id": 2709542798,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I'm not sure this is correct (even though these used to get added) because the entries added in extcap don't have the full path so looking for them in the base prog_dir won't work. Thus maybe some of the other CMake commands that use PROGLIST don't find them?",
